Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:35:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban): compose dynamic probe allocations and preclaim
 refusal contracts [daveey]

Exercise real allocator metadata at the dispatch tier seam, preserving conservative unknown-provider hold, scoped provider independence, interval and probe custody with null stored selectors. Update legacy unknown-author and structural-refusal consumers to require no new claims/runs or failure-budget spend. Full static check green; provider96green then combined transport/probe green; accounting162passed2failed retained at bounded two-iteration stop. Unexpected resolver-fault sibling fixture still lacks assignee-specific class eligibility; remaining class consumers and full fleet acceptance remain open. Not review or landing-ready.
